<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-08T14:24:39.936Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 14:24:39 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces maintain a month-long siege of Taiz while Yemeni government troops have taken the al-Jawf mountain range, intensifying front-line fighting. In Riyadh, Houthis damaged the Saudi Aramco tower in the financial district, and the Saudi-led coalition intercepted a Houthi cruise missile, a long-range anti-tank guided missile and downed a ballistic missile aimed at Medina. A Saudi strike near Sanaa killed 22 civilians, mostly women and children, and a Houthi-claimed airstrike near the capital killed 22 people. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/08/world/middleeast/saudi-aramco-tower-riyadh-hit.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/project-force-2/2026/11/8/after-rebel-offensive-efforts-to-push-them-back-appear-to-have-stalled?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168730&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOam9zc1FkUTVXSWFQS0FvbG5pRlRaTjVyRDNrU0pubVYtU1Q2SUM3T0NuVWltenY4VUNXRGh6LW1fLWRxcFVKWEhyY2ZlODZHdEV5UkJiNkhBOHpYUUY2U3FLNnM3RHpkS3o3Tm9jNnEzUEg1VGdCdmlHV0trMDdEX3p5UWp6XzJFTEtyWlBTUFhocldQcXlJeTg1N3d6d0FSMGk4WVdwZW16Q3Q4dlZTdDVoSm_SAboBQVVfeXFMTnlpdEw5V3RCT3NRU2pOUUdmSExLODRyNVY5US1jTnkyWG9POFRpM3JGMVFEb0ZpZ2ZieFBWd1Brd0kyQll0dlBtenRZQjVoQ2J6UDBQSFlCVDhfNU5obnpHM0lLYkpRVHJvUmt6YkRzc3loMnpiSnUtczlrOHdFTm5rNWVmdlJGbWt2RXhnbUxyaDBoRkN2dXBmM3R1T2JTczhaUEpiV3hZbmpVV1ZSSjh3ZUNQRXFNOVJn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNU19DajRQTHE4Z25PN1BCcHhpNENBSWZiVHJaOWZXNjBGQldFd0VldkZlY05YUlNTVlp1WEVodFRmdW56T3RFVUI1TlFUY1JrenVRaE8xS091NmVMWE51SmZ3WFV0VE5UUFJTdFVlaFBnT